{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Beat Bulwark",
    "steam_appid": 3793710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793710/extras/de19e4150fcc93d305cf5fc3d1ac710e.avif?t=1750701546\" width=512 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Beat Bulwark, the world is connected to pulse - which has begun to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the heart of the world to restore it by ending the corruption in this</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short, difficult, rhythm-based action platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and fight to the beat through challenging handcrafted levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most actions are locked to the beat of the music, which shifts based on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your performance</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual and haptic cues (controller recommended) help to find the flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and keep it</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and the environment also move to the beat, so planning your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >course of action is key!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new, exciting abilities as you progress toward the heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay previous levels to attempt to improve your fastest time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the heart and renew the pulse!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793710/extras/de19e4150fcc93d305cf5fc3d1ac710e.avif?t=1750701546\" width=512 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Beat Bulwark, the world is connected to pulse - which has begun to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the heart of the world to restore it by ending the corruption in this</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short, difficult, rhythm-based action platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and fight to the beat through challenging handcrafted levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most actions are locked to the beat of the music, which shifts based on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your performance</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual and haptic cues (controller recommended) help to find the flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and keep it</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and the environment also move to the beat, so planning your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >course of action is key!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new, exciting abilities as you progress toward the heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay previous levels to attempt to improve your fastest time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the heart and renew the pulse!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The world is bound to a now-fading pulse. You must restore it. Jump, attack, and maneuver on beat with the music through handcrafted levels in this short, challenging, rhythm-based action platformer. Unlock new abilities, defeat the corruption, and then replay levels to improve your best times!",
